raph","text":"金メダルを賭けた決勝戦は\n日本時間 19日 8時キックオフ予定！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から応援しています！\n頑張ってください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/07/18/2645012/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23:30〜24:50 NHK総合にて、ケータイ大喜利が放送されます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白い番組です！！\n是非みてくださいね(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豪華な皆さんと一緒に収録に参加できて\nとても良い経験になりました\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トーク、もっと勉強しないといけないな、\nと感じました...( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります！！( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/07/18/2645012/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこれからテスト勉強に励みます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハも頑張ります..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世の大学生よ。\n踏ん張りどきですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共に、戦おう。( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/07/18/2645012/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ナマステ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ブログの)別れ際、もっと好きになった？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはる"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-453":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br